0.tsv.gz\n\t\t\thttps://github.com/gxy-gxy/Search-R1-for-DeepRAG/tree/main\n\t\t\thttps://github.com/PeterGriffinJin/Search-R1","level":1,"path_id":"1~32","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":36,"section_id":"sec-1~32"}],"citations":[{"raw_text":"Self-rag: Learning to retrieve, generate, and critique through self-reflection\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAkariAsai\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZeqiuWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYizhongWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAvirupSil\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHannanehHajishirzi\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2310.11511\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2023\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2310.11511","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b0","section_path_id":"1~4","quote":"(Asai et al., 2023;","offset":4389},{"ref_id":"b0","section_path_id":"1~5","quote":"(Asai et al., 2023)","offset":272}]},{"raw_text":"Semantic parsing on freebase from question-answer pairs\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJonathanBerant\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAndrewChou\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRoyFrostig\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPercyLiang\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tProceedings of the 2013 conference on empirical methods in natural language processing\n\t\tthe 2013 conference on empirical methods in natural language processing\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2013","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Semantic parsing on freebase from question-answer pairs","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b1","section_path_id":"4.1","quote":"(Berant et al., 2013)","offset":361}]},{"raw_text":"Understanding retrieval augmentation for long-form question answering\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHung-TingChen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFangyuanXu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShaneArora\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tEunsolChoi\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2310.12150\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2023\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2310.12150","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b2","section_path_id":"1~4","quote":"(Chen et al., 2023;","offset":1801}]},{"raw_text":"Towards reasoning era: A survey of long chain-of-thought for reasoning large language models\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQiguangChen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLiboQin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJinhaoLiu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDengyunPeng\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJiannanGuan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPengWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMengkangHu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYuhangZhou\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTeGao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWanxiangChe\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2503.09567\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2025\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2503.09567","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b3","section_path_id":"1~5","quote":"(Chen et al., 2025)","offset":242}]},{"raw_text":"Unified active retrieval for retrieval augmented generation\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQinyuanCheng\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXiaonanLi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShiminLi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQinZhu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZhangyueYin\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYunfanShao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLinyangLi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTianxiangSun\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tHangYan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXipengQiu\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2406.12534\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWikipedia contributors. 2025. Phi coefficient -Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2024\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2406.12534","title":"Unified active retrieval for retrieval augmented generation","anchors":[{"ref_id":"b4","section_path_id":"1~4","quote":"(Cheng et al., 2024;","offset":4126},{"ref_id":"b4","section_path_id":"1~5","quote":"(Cheng et al., 2024)","offset":1242},{"ref_id":"b4","section_path_id":"4.2","quote":"(Cheng et al., 2024)","offset":770}]},{"raw_text":"To retrieve or not to retrieve? uncertainty detection for dynamic retrieval augmented generation\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDKaustubh\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tDhole\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2501.09292\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2025\n\t\t\n\t\n\tPreprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2501.09292","title":null,"anchors":[{"ref_id":"b5","section_path_id":"1~4","quote":"Dhole, 2025)","offset":4294}]},{"raw_text":"AbhimanyuDubey\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAbhinavJauhri\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAbhinavPandey\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAbhishekKadian\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAhmadAl-Dahle\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAieshaLetman\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAkhilMathur\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAlanSchelten\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAmyYang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAngelaFan\n\t\t\n\t\tarX